  "title": "Lamb and Winter Vegetable Stew",
  "description": "This hearty lamb and winter vegetable stew recipe made with sweet potatoes is definitely worth the time. You can substitute beef tips for the lamb.",
  "authors": [
    "BJSCHADE"
  ],
